                "type": "text",
                "text": " tests. The first one opens two contexts, and for each one of them opens some buffers. Now, for one of them, it does NOT close the buffer descriptor. So, when the test finishes, it does not fail, but then there is still an ongoing closing of the buffer and then the last context. The issue is, that the second test opens "
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "MAX_CONTEXTS",
                "style": {
